&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ramya Krishnan&lt;/strong&gt;, Senior Staff Attorney, Knight First Amendment Institute; Lecturer in Law, Columbia Law School&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;George Wang&lt;/strong&gt;, Staff Attorney, Knight First Amendment Institute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
